au14-job-name-tribal-leader = 部落首领
au14-job-description-tribal-leader = 团结部落，领导保卫你的母星。不惜一切代价驱逐入侵者。
au14-job-prefix-tribal-leader = ELDER

au14-job-name-tribal-spear = 部落战士
au14-job-description-tribal-spear = 部落中手持长矛的战士。在近战中保卫你的母星。
au14-job-prefix-tribal-spear = WARRIOR

au14-job-name-tribal-bowman = 部落弓手
au14-job-description-tribal-bowman = 部落中技艺娴熟的弓箭手。从远处打击入侵者。
au14-job-prefix-tribal-bowman = HUNTER

au14-job-name-tribal-shaman = 部落萨满
au14-job-description-tribal-shaman = 部落的治疗者与精神向导。救治受伤的战士，让队伍存活下去。
au14-job-prefix-tribal-shaman = SHAMAN